  "slug": "shift-swap-evaluation-form",
  "title": "Shift Swap Evaluation Form",
  "subtitle": "Use this evaluation to apply explicit criteria to traceable evidence, calibrate the conclusion, authorize action, and preserve limitations for a shift swap workflow.",
  "description": "An original operational shift swap evaluation form that controls a paired schedule-change and coverage record from identity and routing through evidence, qualified decision, exception management, implementation, handoff, and final verification.",
  "use_case": "Use when the requesting workers, scheduler, or shift manager needs a traceable evaluation so the authorized scheduling, payroll, operations, or HR reviewer can approve, conditionally approve, deny, cancel, reverse, or correct the proposed shift exchange under the current schedule, role-qualification matrix, rest and overtime rules, labor agreement, and applicable scheduling policy without relying on an informal email, spreadsheet, or unreviewed narrative.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
